-- GammaI.seg: what each declaration's informal text opens.
-- Notation (opened to expose the shape of a type: "A x", a pair, Id Bool _ true):
--   Cl Cap Sub Eqv Iff Bar OTc tau M scA Dn PsiP Mid Cs G2 C4 Tr LT TT OK InC NFphi, the
--   closure packages DSum WDp WDo DCard, Lf (a set as a class), WW (Def. 4.25), Emp, H430,
--   and this file's notions and packages: Hq CW Str Pcw Gam GS Gn Gw Two P437 Bs P438 and
--   their accessors (hq-o, cw-c, pc-k, pc-ww, gs-set, gs-sub, gw-n, ...).
-- The two levels: InC (inc-up, inc-dn), as OK, LT in WW.seg.
-- The stages: it, Stage, gs-set (Gamma^{n+1} = Gamma^n u Gamma'(Gamma^n) by definition of it,
--   in stage-l, stage-r; its uses through Pcw's proof argument, in next-pc and rem437);
--   plusN (by definition) in plusN-z, plusN-s, plusN-comm, stage-up, two; sucN.
-- Definitions opened where the text says "by definition" or "computation":
--   lt cmp2 fwd ifB or le leOf other cl68 isI (clause (6): psi_k y <' I iff k <=' I, lt-psi-ii);
--   up cardS (psi_k y+ = k, up-psi); isI isT (I = I, I in T', in comp-I, comp-leaf,
--   psi-hi-abs, rem438a, inc-of, step438, comp-str, comp-lo).
Hq: Cl
hq-o: Hq
hq-t: Cl Hq
hq-c:
CW: Cl
cw-inc: CW
cw-c: Cl CW
inc-up: InC Tr
inc-dn: InC Tr
cw-ww: Cap Sub tau
ww-in: Cl Cap Sub Bar OTc ww-set Eqv Seg Lf WW
ww-out: Cap Cl ww-set Lf WW
Str: Cl
Pcw: Cl Sub Lf
Gam: Cl
str-sound: Cl Str Sub Lf PsiP
pc-k: Cl Pcw
pc-lt: Cl Pcw Sub Hq pc-k
pc-ww: Pcw Cl Sub Hq Lf pc-k
pc-in: Cl Pcw Sub Hq pc-k pc-ww
pc-sound: Cl Cap Sub Hq Pcw OTc
gam-sound: Cl Gam Lf Sub CW Hq
GS: Cl
gs-set: Cl GS
gs-sub: Cl GS gs-set
Gn: Cl GS
gn-sound: Cl Sub Lf Gam gs-set GS Gn Hq
emp-sub: Cl Sub Emp Lf
it: GS Cl Hq
Stage:
stage-sub: gs-set it Sub Hq Stage Lf
stage-l: gs-set Stage it Gn Hq
stage-r: gs-set it Stage Hq gs-sub Cl Sub Gn Lf stage-sub
Gw:
gw-n: Gw
gw-in: Gw Hq gw-n
plusN:
plusN-z: plusN sucN
plusN-s: plusN sucN
plusN-comm: sucN plusN
stage-up: plusN Hq
Two:
two: Gw Hq Two Stage gs-set gw-n it plusN
next-str: Cl Gam Gw Hq
next-pc: Hq Stage gs-set it Cl Sub Gam Gw Lf
gw-one: Cl Gw Hq
gw-two: Two Gw Cl Hq
P437: Cl
cw-dc: Cl
leaf-I: Cl Sub OTc Mid isI
lt-psi-ii: fwd cmp2 ifB isI lt or cl68 le leOf other
psi-hi-abs: Tr LT isI isT OK TT
up-psi: C4 cardS up
comp-str: PsiP Gw Tr P437 Lf Cl Hq isT TT Str
comp-I: Cl Cap Tr PsiP Gw Hq P437 isI InC OK LT WW
comp-lo2: Cl Cap Gw Hq LT Tr Pcw
comp-lo: Cl Cap Gw isT TT Tr Hq P437 Lf
comp-leaf: Tr Cap Gw Cl Hq isI isT TT P437 InC OK
rem437: Cl Gw P437 Lf Str DSum WDp NFphi Stage gs-set it WDo Hq NFom
Bs: Cl
bs-bar: Cap Bs Lf Cl Sub tau Hq Bar
inc-of: Tr LT isI isT Cs InC TT Hq OK
bs-dn: Cap Cl tau Gw Lf Dn Bs Sub Hq P437
hq-of: Cl scA M Hq
rem438a: Cl scA isI H430
w438: Cl Sub scA
below438: Cl
fi438: G2 Cl scA M WW Cap Sub tau DCard LT Tr
rem438b: scA M G2 Cl LT Tr
P438:
step438: Cl Cap Sub tau P438 M scA isT TT Tr
rem438c: Cap Cl Eqv Iff Sub P438
